## 📝 코드 샘플

### parse() 호출 예시
```freelang
let source = "fn hello input name: string output string return \"Hello, \" + name"
let ast = parse(source)

# AST 구조:
# {
#   type: "Program",
#   body: [
#     {
#       type: "FunctionDeclaration",
#       id: { type: "Identifier", name: "hello" },
#       params: ["name"],
#       body: [...]
#     }
#   ]
# }
```

### 파서 함수 호출 순서
```
parse()
  → tokenize() [Phase 1]
  → parser_init()
  → parseProgram()
    → parseStatement()
      → parseFunctionDeclaration()
        → parseStatement()
          → parseReturnStatement()
            → parseExpression()
              → parseAdditive()
                → parseMultiplicative()
                  → parsePrimary() [생성: Literal("Hello, ")]
              → parseMultiplicative()
                → parsePrimary() [생성: Identifier("name")]
```

